---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
  { label: '7,000m Word List' }
];

const cheatSheetSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": "The 7,000m Words List for Krillion: Ultimate Hadal Abyss Answers",
  "description": "A curated cheat sheet of ultra-rare valid answers across Roman emperors, geography enclaves, chemistry, and Shakespeare for Krillion reverse trivia.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Krillion Strategy Guild"
  }
};
---

<Layout
  title="7,000m Words List for Krillion | The Ultimate Hadal Abyss Cheat Sheet - Krillion.si"
  description="Master every prompt in Krillion with our curated 7,000m words list. Discover ultra-rare valid answers across Roman emperors, geography enclaves, chemistry, and Shakespeare."
  schema={cheatSheetSchema}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 prose prose-invert prose-cyan">
    <div class="not-prose mb-8 space-y-3">
      <Breadcrumb items={breadcrumbs} />
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/60 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-bold font-mono">
        <span>CURATED KNOWLEDGE VAULT</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white leading-tight">
        The 7,000m Words List for Krillion: Ultimate Hadal Abyss Answers
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm">
        Compiled by Krillion Strategy Guild • Updated 2026 • 7 min read
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-abyss-card border border-cyan-500/30 rounded-3xl p-6 my-8 not-prose space-y-3 shadow-lg shadow-cyan-950/20">
      <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-400 flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9H4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H6"/><path d="M18 9h1.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5H18"/><path d="M4 22h16"/><path d="M10 14.66V17c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H7v4h10v-4h-2c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-2.34"/><path d="M6 4h12v5a6 6 0 0 1-12 0V4Z"/></svg>
        <span>Why This Cheat Sheet Exists</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        In Krillion, reaching the maximum depth of <strong>7,000 meters</strong> requires answering with valid factual items chosen by fewer than 1% of global participants. Below is an exhaustive study sheet categorized by high-frequency trivia domains.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2>1. World Geography & Microstates</h2>
    <h3>Southern Hemisphere Nations</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Surface (Do Not Use):</strong> Australia, Brazil, South Africa, Argentina</li>
      <li><strong>Trap (3,000m):</strong> Madagascar, Uruguay, Bolivia, Botswana</li>
      <li><strong class="text-cyan-400">7,000m Hadal Answers:</strong> <code>Nauru</code>, <code>Tuvalu</code>, <code>Vanuatu</code>, <code>Eswatini</code>, <code>Lesotho</code>, <code>Kiribati</code>, <code>Tonga</code>, <code>Samoa</code>, <code>Burundi</code>, <code>Malawi</code></li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Landlocked Sovereign Nations</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Surface:</strong> Switzerland, Austria, Mongolia, Nepal</li>
      <li><strong>Trap:</strong> Luxembourg, Liechtenstein, Czech Republic, Afghanistan</li>
      <li><strong class="text-cyan-400">7,000m Hadal Answers:</strong> <code>San Marino</code>, <code>Andorra</code>, <code>Bhutan</code>, <code>Burkina Faso</code>, <code>Chad</code>, <code>Central African Republic</code>, <code>Laos</code>, <code>Niger</code></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Ancient & World History</h2>
    <h3>Roman Emperors (Pre-Western Fall)</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Surface:</strong> Julius Caesar (Dictator), Augustus, Nero, Marcus Aurelius, Constantine</li>
      <li><strong>Trap:</strong> Caligula, Claudius, Hadrian, Trajan, Diocletian, Commodus</li>
      <li><strong class="text-cyan-400">7,000m Hadal Answers:</strong> <code>Pertinax</code>, <code>Didius Julianus</code>, <code>Pescennius Niger</code>, <code>Gordian I</code>, <code>Pupienus</code>, <code>Balbinus</code>, <code>Majorian</code>, <code>Tacitus</code>, <code>Florianus</code></li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Historical Peace Treaties (Pre-2000)</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Surface:</strong> Treaty of Versailles, Treaty of Paris, Camp David Accords</li>
      <li><strong>Trap:</strong> Peace of Westphalia, Treaty of Utrecht, Treaty of Brest-Litovsk</li>
      <li><strong class="text-cyan-400">7,000m Hadal Answers:</strong> <code>Treaty of Kadesh</code> (c. 1259 BC), <code>Treaty of Wedmore</code>, <code>Treaty of Verdun</code>, <code>Treaty of Hubertusburg</code>, <code>Treaty of Nystad</code></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Physical Science & Chemistry</h2>
    <h3>Transition Metals on the Periodic Table</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Surface:</strong> Gold, Silver, Iron, Copper, Platinum</li>
      <li><strong>Trap:</strong> Titanium, Tungsten, Mercury, Cobalt, Zinc</li>
      <li><strong class="text-cyan-400">7,000m Hadal Answers:</strong> <code>Rhenium</code>, <code>Hafnium</code>, <code>Ruthenium</code>, <code>Tantalum</code>, <code>Osmium</code>, <code>Iridium</code>, <code>Scandium</code>, <code>Vanadium</code></li>
    </ul>

    <!-- Bottom CTA Bar -->
    <div class="mt-12 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-abyss-card border border-cyan-500/30 text-center not-prose space-y-4 shadow-xl">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white">Memorized the Vault?</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 max-w-md mx-auto">
        Put these Hadal candidates to the test in the live arena.
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="/#game" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-blue-500 text-slate-950 font-black text-xs hover:scale-105 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/20">
          Play Daily Dive Now ⚓
        </a>
        <a href="/endless" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-white font-bold text-xs border border-white/10 transition-all">
          Train on Endless Mode
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
